WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:12.109
Oh, we're bloody funny, aren't we?

00:00:12.109 --> 00:00:12.942
Comedy gold.

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:15.499
