actually, pretty much.

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:40.851
More importantly.

00:00:40.851 --> 00:00:42.770
Can you play Angry Birds on it?

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.560
Yeah, of course you can.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:46.540
So here we are at our challenge area.

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.623
Right, so...

00:00:47.623 --> 00:00:49.355
We have to run from here to over there.

00:00:49.355 --> 00:00:50.188
Yep.

00:00:50.188 --> 00:00:51.021
'Cross the garden,

00:00:51.021 --> 00:00:53.113
whilst writing with this
pen on the ThinkPad.

00:00:53.113 --> 00:00:54.942
"I heard various explosions,"

00:00:54.942 --> 00:00:57.053
the famous quote from
my granddad over there.

00:00:57.053 --> 00:00:59.502
I heard various explosions earlier.

00:00:59.502 --> 00:01:01.233
Various explosions...

00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:02.814
Various explosions.

00:01:02.814 --> 00:01:04.292
Yeah. Nailed it.

00:01:04.292 --> 00:01:05.943
Doesn't sound very hard, to be honest.

00:01:05.943 --> 00:01:07.063
It doesn't, does it?

00:01:07.063 --> 00:01:08.442
Make a pretty land video. as well.

00:01:08.442 --> 00:01:10.225
So we're going to be blindfolded

00:01:10.225 --> 00:01:12.290
